    Cc: marc.zyngier@arm.com
    Cc: Catalin.Marinas@arm.com
    Cc: guohanjun@huawei.com
    Cc: Will.Deacon@arm.com
    Cc: huxinwei@huawei.com
    Cc: lizefan@huawei.com
    Cc: dingtianhong@huawei.com
